 "differences": [
  "SST go accuracy (Table 2: TD 98.09, DCD 97.83, DCD+pDCD 97.70) comes out at 97.56, 97.50 and 97.36 from these rows. The authors' own per-run go accuracy in SSTmetrics.csv equals the rows' on 145 of 155 runs and the other 10 differ by at most 1.56 points; the cause of the gap to Table 2 was not found.",
  "The Wilcoxon W of the SST median go RT comparisons (95.5 for TD vs DCD and 694.5 for TD vs DCD+pDCD in the paper) was not reproduced (333 and 586 here, runs as units); the means of the same measure do reproduce.",
  "CRTmetrics.csv counts 36 false alarms (key presses on fixation-only trials) in total, but CRT_alldata.csv records an RT on only 10 fixation trials (equal for 58 of 79 participants), so the false alarms cannot be recovered from the trial file."
 ],
